    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Create order\nPOST {{host}}/v1/order/create\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nproduct_id=&quantity=\n",
    "markdown": "# Shorthand API\nAPI with shorthand template syntax (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [order](#order)\n\n## order\n\n### Create order\n\n`POST /v1/order/create`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `product_id` | integer | Yes | Product ID |\n| `quantity` | integer | Yes | Quantity |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `201` — OrderResponse\n- `422` — OrderError\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Shorthand API\nAPI with shorthand template syntax (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Create order\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"product_id=\" \\\n  -d \"quantity=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/order/create\"\n",
